WEBVTT

00:09.980 --> 00:12.490
(No looky)

00:15.990 --> 00:16.990
It happened.

00:16.990 --> 00:19.990
A tragedy befell our girlfriends.

00:24.170 --> 00:27.000
It all began with the Food Fight Festival.

00:27.750 --> 00:32.759
It led to the girls consuming
a teensy bit more food than before.

00:35.130 --> 00:36.640
And slowly...

00:40.890 --> 00:44.670
but surely, it came for them.

00:46.600 --> 00:47.860
(Food Fight Festival)

00:47.860 --> 00:49.230
(The Eating Contest Classic)

00:48.500 --> 00:49.240
The chickens

00:49.230 --> 00:51.110
(Doesn't gain weight
no matter how much she eats)

00:49.240 --> 00:51.110
had come home to roost.

00:51.110 --> 00:53.030
(Didn't participate
in the Food Fight Festival)

00:53.410 --> 00:57.940
We'll head home after our
top-secret girlfriend training session.

00:53.700 --> 00:57.780
Hey, wait! I don't need it!

00:57.940 --> 01:02.240
You're already the cutest,
and still you aim for greater heights?!

01:03.060 --> 01:04.500
They'll set Guinness records.

01:04.500 --> 01:06.480
Investigate Guinness if they don't.

01:06.480 --> 01:08.100
We're looking for members!

01:08.630 --> 01:11.740
The girls baseball team needs your help!

01:08.630 --> 01:12.630
(Girls Baseball Team)

01:11.740 --> 01:14.430
Would you like to join
the girls baseball team?

01:14.840 --> 01:18.640
She's been recruiting every day lately.

01:14.840 --> 01:16.780
I'm actually on club duties right now.

01:16.780 --> 01:18.640
Aren't you in the Go Home club?

01:18.930 --> 01:20.080
Sorry.

01:20.080 --> 01:21.330
No, I'm sorry for stopping you.

01:21.330 --> 01:22.130
Come on, let's go.

01:22.130 --> 01:23.680
Good luck going home!

01:46.710 --> 01:51.920
(The 100 Girlfriends Who Really, Really,
Really, Really, REALLY Love You)

01:52.750 --> 01:55.590
(Karane
as the Tsundere Princess)

01:55.590 --> 01:57.880
(Demonstration
Tea-Time Prep)

01:57.880 --> 01:59.470
(Hakari
Suggestive Weight-Loss Running)

01:59.470 --> 02:00.720
(Kurumi
Ate all of the school store's bread)

02:00.720 --> 02:02.220
(Mimimi
(Getting ready) Two hours later)

02:03.390 --> 02:05.930
(Nano
Robot that exercises for her)

02:05.930 --> 02:08.350
(Shizuka
Has 365 book recommendations this week)

02:08.350 --> 02:10.650
(Kusuri
Has newly developed drug
that gives you sweet dreams)

02:10.650 --> 02:11.310
(Hahari
Chairperson's Address "Education" and "Love")

02:11.310 --> 02:11.980
(Iku
Has been doing push-ups since yesterday)

02:11.980 --> 02:13.520
(Meme
Customized Plushy- Rentaro-kun)

02:13.650 --> 02:18.360
(Rentaro-kun Appreciation Opening)

02:21.110 --> 02:22.780
(Meme-san added ears
and a tail for you!)

02:28.410 --> 02:30.460
(Rentaro-kun (& Others) Appreciation Opening)

03:07.660 --> 03:11.040
Huh? Er, uh... um...

03:12.370 --> 03:14.680
Would you like to join
the girls baseball team?!

03:14.680 --> 03:15.790
I'm a boy!

03:16.870 --> 03:19.670
R-Right you are! I apologize!

03:21.400 --> 03:24.400
That's weird. What's gotten into me?

03:24.400 --> 03:26.300
So, you are...?

03:27.220 --> 03:31.400
Right. I'm Sutou Iku,
a first-year on the girls baseball team.

03:31.400 --> 03:34.560
I'm Aijo Rentaro. I'm in Class 1-4.

03:34.560 --> 03:37.320
Hey, we're neighbors. I'm in 1-3.

03:38.700 --> 03:41.070
Sorry, you were busy recruiting.

03:41.070 --> 03:46.780
Oh, yeah. We have a practice game
next weekend.

03:47.329 --> 03:51.079
If we don't win it, the girls
baseball team will be disbanded.

03:51.550 --> 03:53.960
There's that familiar anime
and manga trope!

03:54.680 --> 03:58.190
But we don't have enough
team members to play.

03:58.190 --> 04:00.490
So that's why you've been recruiting.

04:00.490 --> 04:03.540
Baseball needs teams of nine, right?

04:03.540 --> 04:04.970
How many more do you need?

04:04.970 --> 04:06.180
We need eight.

04:06.180 --> 04:08.100
You and who else?!

04:08.450 --> 04:11.730
Can you even call yourself
a baseball team?

04:11.730 --> 04:15.480
It wasn't always like this. There were
nine of us until half a month ago.

04:16.079 --> 04:17.860
We'll be national champions!

04:16.680 --> 04:21.779
We swore to be national champions one day.

04:17.860 --> 04:20.180
Yeah!

04:22.700 --> 04:24.110
That's why...

04:24.610 --> 04:28.340
They all left to train in
the birthplace of baseball, America.

04:28.340 --> 04:30.030
Talk about committed to the bit!

04:31.160 --> 04:35.270
I must make sure the baseball team
is ready and waiting for their return.

04:35.700 --> 04:38.980
That's why I decided to remain here.

04:39.680 --> 04:41.520
But what can you do alone?

04:41.520 --> 04:43.010
In this world,

04:43.320 --> 04:47.300
nothing is impossible if you put in
the work like your life depends on it!

04:47.300 --> 04:49.010
If something is impossible,

04:49.010 --> 04:52.080
that just means
you didn't work hard enough!

04:52.080 --> 04:54.020
Hoo boy, the hustle culture grindset.

04:54.340 --> 04:58.060
Well, this is all I can do
by myself right now.

04:58.060 --> 05:02.940
But I do it hoping people see it
and take an interest in baseball.

05:02.940 --> 05:04.490
That explains the practice swings.

05:04.490 --> 05:07.950
10,126! 10,127!

05:07.950 --> 05:09.460
Did you add an extra zero there?!

05:08.830 --> 05:10.570
10,128!

05:10.940 --> 05:13.370
Hey, I come to school four hours early,

05:13.370 --> 05:16.250
and I'm here recruiting every recess, too.

05:16.250 --> 05:17.670
Talk about stoic!

05:17.980 --> 05:20.060
D-Don't your arms hurt?

05:20.060 --> 05:23.080
They do, but you know how in workouts,

05:23.080 --> 05:26.050
the harder it is, the bigger the gains!
And that's fun, don't you think?

05:26.050 --> 05:31.120
Ah, yeah. Like how muscle ache
is a sign that you're getting stronger.

05:28.430 --> 05:32.060
(Wall squatting)

05:31.120 --> 05:32.060
Exactly!

05:32.850 --> 05:34.810
Arms creaking in pain!

05:35.100 --> 05:36.750
Fingers hanging on by a thread!

05:37.310 --> 05:39.909
A body awash with agony!

05:40.560 --> 05:43.409
Ooh, the suffering!

05:43.409 --> 05:45.440
Why's it sound like there's
a heart emoji at the end?!

05:47.180 --> 05:48.450
Sutou-san?!

05:48.800 --> 05:51.460
D-Don't push yourself too hard.

05:51.460 --> 05:56.080
N-No... I have to work harder...

05:56.540 --> 05:59.710
I haven't suffered enough.

05:59.710 --> 06:02.920
Not until it hurts so bad,
I'm about to break!

05:59.710 --> 06:05.710
(goosebumps)

06:02.920 --> 06:05.710
Wait, that's not stoicism!
It's just masochism!

06:09.030 --> 06:11.850
Uh, If you don't mind...

06:12.200 --> 06:15.210
Is there anything I can do to help?

06:15.210 --> 06:16.100
Huh?

06:16.100 --> 06:18.880
You'll be able to do
other things with me here.

06:18.880 --> 06:21.730
It'll also save you from
pushing yourself too hard.

06:22.120 --> 06:24.110
Are you sure? Thanks!

06:24.450 --> 06:25.500
To start off...

06:26.600 --> 06:31.820
Could you pummel my tummy
with this bat while I practice my swing?

06:31.820 --> 06:34.170
Who in their right mind
would join a team like that?!

06:34.930 --> 06:36.500
W-Well, in that case...

06:36.800 --> 06:39.870
The girls baseball team needs you!

06:43.480 --> 06:44.860
One more!

06:45.380 --> 06:47.630
The girls baseball team needs you!

06:48.409 --> 06:49.380
One more!

06:49.380 --> 06:50.340
We need you!

06:50.970 --> 06:51.930
One more!

06:51.930 --> 06:52.430
We need—

06:52.430 --> 06:53.260
One more!

06:53.260 --> 06:53.600
We—

06:53.600 --> 06:54.280
One more!

06:54.280 --> 06:57.310
The girls baseball team
is looking for members!

06:55.940 --> 06:58.980
One more!

07:00.980 --> 07:03.730
(Girls Baseball Team)

07:04.220 --> 07:06.180
Th-Thanks.

07:06.180 --> 07:09.150
I know you must be way more
exhausted than I am.

07:09.460 --> 07:11.000
And you're still giving me a massage.

07:11.000 --> 07:13.160
Nah, you did me a favor.

07:13.600 --> 07:16.890
I got to spend a really productive
time thanks to you, Aijo-kun.

07:16.890 --> 07:18.680
I really appreciate it!

07:18.680 --> 07:21.920
Baseball really is more fun
with more people.

07:22.870 --> 07:25.920
She must really love baseball.

07:25.920 --> 07:28.410
I can help out after school tomorrow too.

07:28.410 --> 07:31.100
Really? You're the best, Aijo-kun!

07:30.140 --> 07:33.220
How can I help the baseball team survive?

07:33.680 --> 07:35.430
(The Next Day)

07:35.430 --> 07:38.290
I can't wait till classes end.

07:38.290 --> 07:40.430
I'll get to play baseball
with Aijo-kun again...

07:41.480 --> 07:43.190
I never thought the day would come...

07:44.500 --> 07:46.760
when I would fall in love.

07:49.540 --> 07:50.830
It's Aijo-kun!

07:50.830 --> 07:52.150
Hey—

07:56.340 --> 07:57.800
Something on your mind?

07:57.800 --> 07:59.580
Huh? Kinda...

08:08.520 --> 08:11.440
I'm here, Sutou-san. Let's get to work—

08:11.440 --> 08:12.430
Aijo-kun.

08:13.420 --> 08:15.340
There's something I need to tell you.

08:26.470 --> 08:30.230
Aijo-kun, please go out with me.

08:42.789 --> 08:43.929
I'm sorry.

08:45.850 --> 08:47.630
You see, the thing is,

08:48.370 --> 08:50.240
I have eight girlfriends already.

08:50.810 --> 08:57.140
Any more, and there's no guarantee
I can make them all happy.

08:58.130 --> 08:59.160
So that's it.

08:58.790 --> 09:04.540
I don't want to be irresponsible
and end up hurting you.

08:59.890 --> 09:05.780
My first love, and... my first heartbreak.

09:08.060 --> 09:11.280
(goosebumps)

09:08.360 --> 09:11.280
The suffering!

09:11.280 --> 09:14.780
My heart feels like it's been torn apart!

09:12.310 --> 09:14.780
It hurts! It hurts!

09:15.160 --> 09:25.200
The pain, it hurts!

09:15.170 --> 09:18.520
The pain, the suffering...

09:19.020 --> 09:22.500
Thank you, Aijo-kun, for showing me...

09:22.500 --> 09:28.290
that this world contains
such incredible pain!

09:31.960 --> 09:34.110
Blood?!

09:34.110 --> 09:36.790
Wh-Wh-What's wrong, Aijo-kun?!

09:43.740 --> 09:45.560
S-So, actually...

09:49.180 --> 09:50.400
Sutou-san?

09:50.400 --> 09:54.390
This is bad! Did seeing me hold
hands with Nano give her a shock?

09:55.940 --> 09:58.560
W-Wait, is she...

09:58.560 --> 10:01.760
Is she enjoying the agony of heartbreak?

10:02.560 --> 10:04.880
What's wrong? You're sweating profusely.

10:04.880 --> 10:06.210
There's a chance you have a fever.

10:06.210 --> 10:07.480
N-Nah...

10:08.080 --> 10:12.090
Ooh, the pain!

10:10.590 --> 10:12.590
She's definitely enjoying it!

10:13.410 --> 10:17.340
Since you asked me
knowing that I had a girlfriend,

10:17.340 --> 10:21.880
you must've been trying to experience
the pain of being rejected.

10:22.270 --> 10:27.780
W-Wow, Aijo-kun, you saw
right through me. How embarrassing.

10:27.780 --> 10:31.550
So, yeah, I pretended to reject you,

10:31.550 --> 10:34.040
but it was too much for me.

10:34.040 --> 10:36.110
It made you spew all this blood?

10:36.110 --> 10:39.590
Wait... Pretended to reject me?

10:39.590 --> 10:41.490
My real answer...

10:41.860 --> 10:43.170
is yes.

10:43.170 --> 10:49.580
Seeing you put in all that work made me
want to stand by you and support you.

10:49.580 --> 10:53.500
But you said you had
eight girlfriends already...

10:53.500 --> 10:56.630
and there was no guarantee
you could make everyone happy...

10:57.020 --> 11:00.630
Yeah, there's no guarantee, but I...

11:00.630 --> 11:03.980
I will make you all happy
even if it kills me!

11:03.980 --> 11:04.640
Hngh!

11:04.640 --> 11:05.800
Even if I bleed out...

11:05.340 --> 11:06.150
Hngh!

11:05.800 --> 11:07.100
or lose all my limbs...

11:06.710 --> 11:07.490
Hngh!

11:07.100 --> 11:10.390
as long as there's a single
cell of me left,

11:09.540 --> 11:10.390
Hngh, hngh!

11:10.390 --> 11:16.150
I'll use every last bit of my life
to make you all happy!

11:16.530 --> 11:18.150
So let's do this!

11:18.150 --> 11:21.200
(hngh!!!)

11:18.440 --> 11:21.200
He's so dedicated
to his girlfriends' happiness!

11:21.200 --> 11:22.950
He's more stoic than me!

11:21.200 --> 11:22.950
(hngh!!!)

11:24.270 --> 11:25.730
You're on!

11:25.730 --> 11:28.200
Uh, why'd that sound like it
came out of a sports anime?!

11:30.070 --> 11:32.540
And there you have it.

11:32.800 --> 11:38.300
May I have your permission to welcome
Sutou Iku-san as my newest girlfriend?

11:38.730 --> 11:41.080
Mei just joined us last episode.

11:41.080 --> 11:44.300
You should be used to this show's
breakneck pacing by now.

11:44.570 --> 11:48.430
I'm Sutou Iku of Class 1-3!
I'm glad to be here!

11:48.430 --> 11:50.060
What is this, a club initiation?!

11:50.410 --> 11:54.660
Please, help me make amends
by smacking my butt with a bat!

11:54.660 --> 11:56.220
Never mind all that.

11:56.220 --> 11:59.320
If Karane-san did that,
you wouldn't even have a butt anymore.

11:59.570 --> 12:02.540
Iku's in the baseball team,
and she's a stoic and hard worker.

12:02.540 --> 12:05.140
She derives pleasure
from pain and suffering.

12:05.140 --> 12:06.830
She's a starter and a sub
at the same time!

12:07.290 --> 12:12.960
Oh, but I asked for the smacks
because I also feel inferior.

12:13.530 --> 12:16.310
It hit me when I saw Eiai-san
in the hallway...

12:17.440 --> 12:20.380
You're all so beautiful and so cute,
I'm no match for you.

12:20.300 --> 12:22.220
(twang!!!)

12:20.380 --> 12:22.220
- So beautiful!
- So cute!

12:22.570 --> 12:24.750
How could I deserve to join you?

12:24.750 --> 12:28.360
I mean, I'm not very girly at all...

12:28.360 --> 12:32.230
Come on now! You're a charming tomboy,
and that's amazing!

12:32.510 --> 12:35.070
We're delighted to have you.

12:35.070 --> 12:37.400
Kusuri whack your butt for ya, aye.

12:37.400 --> 12:38.480
Please do!

12:38.480 --> 12:39.730
One, two...

12:40.080 --> 12:41.390
The pain!

12:42.290 --> 12:44.960
It seems weirdos tend
to assimilate much quicker.

12:45.780 --> 12:48.020
"Do you have a favorite tome?"

12:46.780 --> 12:50.650
I figured Iku'd be able
to break the ice immediately.

12:48.020 --> 12:49.740
What kinda food do you like?

12:49.740 --> 12:51.790
What color are your panties?

12:52.260 --> 12:53.620
My plan might work!

12:53.620 --> 12:56.290
With that said, I have a request to make.

12:57.450 --> 12:58.670
A request?

12:59.210 --> 13:01.460
How do you feel about trying out baseball?

13:02.600 --> 13:06.550
For reasons, the girls baseball team
is in danger of being abolished.

13:06.550 --> 13:10.920
Can't you do something about it,
Chairperson of the Board?

13:10.920 --> 13:15.410
What makes you think I would abuse
my money and powers like that?

13:11.310 --> 13:15.940
(huff puff)

13:15.410 --> 13:15.940
Say what?

13:16.540 --> 13:19.940
If we approved every club,
there'd be no end to it.

13:20.420 --> 13:25.700
I would love to help Iku-chan, but other
clubs have been shut down already.

13:26.060 --> 13:29.750
It would spit in the face of all their members,
and no student deserves that.

13:30.200 --> 13:34.010
Also, if I abuse my power
and this school gets a bad rep,

13:34.010 --> 13:36.600
it would affect your resumes
and career prospects too.

13:35.750 --> 13:38.960
(Graduates of a school ruled by a deviant)

13:36.600 --> 13:38.960
I wouldn't ask so much of you, Hahari-san.

13:39.250 --> 13:42.400
Hahari cares so much about us!

13:42.400 --> 13:44.320
"A model educator."

13:44.320 --> 13:46.590
Nope, she really isn't.

13:46.930 --> 13:49.950
Of course, this is only
if you guys want to.

13:49.950 --> 13:51.350
It's a sudden request,

13:51.350 --> 13:53.950
and you might have other plans.

13:54.350 --> 13:58.290
By the way, will you be there too,
Rentaro-kun?

13:58.290 --> 14:01.230
Of course.
I'll be there to support the team.

14:02.130 --> 14:04.070
A stroke of good fortune.

14:04.350 --> 14:10.030
The girls'd been bored out of their minds
jogging to lose weight the past few days.

14:10.030 --> 14:13.980
So a chance to exercise
with their beloved Rentaro

14:13.980 --> 14:16.960
felt like a blessing
from the heavens above!

14:17.810 --> 14:19.120
- You're on!
- Bring it! - Aye! - "I'll do it!"

14:17.810 --> 14:19.120
- I accept! - In. - I'll do it!

14:19.120 --> 14:20.340
You girls!

14:21.170 --> 14:23.360
Uh, you three can't play.

14:24.020 --> 14:25.640
B-But why?!

14:25.640 --> 14:27.630
Because you're not in high school.

14:30.390 --> 14:32.580
May we at least join for practice?

14:32.580 --> 14:34.970
Food tastes crazy good
after a good workout.

14:34.970 --> 14:35.890
Of course!

14:35.890 --> 14:37.870
Oh, thank you.

14:37.870 --> 14:39.520
Thank you all so much!

14:39.520 --> 14:41.720
That makes six.

14:41.720 --> 14:45.030
Recruiting three more is plenty realistic!

14:45.030 --> 14:50.170
But we gotta win, right?
None of us play any sports.

14:50.170 --> 14:54.660
What matters most in sports is teamwork,
the bond between teammates.

14:55.020 --> 14:58.740
In other words, love!
And on that front, we are unbeatable!

14:58.500 --> 14:59.790
(hngh!!!!)

14:58.740 --> 14:59.790
Hngh!

15:00.130 --> 15:02.490
Let's do this and win, Rentaro Family!

15:02.490 --> 15:04.290
Yeah!

15:05.220 --> 15:07.340
Okay, let's start practice.

15:07.340 --> 15:10.760
The basics come first—throwing
and catching—so play catch!

15:10.760 --> 15:11.860
Okay.

15:11.860 --> 15:12.550
Also...

15:12.910 --> 15:15.820
Kusuri-senpai, one glove is enough.

15:15.820 --> 15:17.430
But this cool.

15:20.440 --> 15:22.690
Here I come, Hahari.

15:25.570 --> 15:30.570
Slow down, Karane-chan.
We're only playing catch.

15:30.570 --> 15:31.820
Urk, sorry.

15:32.250 --> 15:34.740
Here!

15:39.150 --> 15:41.290
This is even faster, though?!

15:43.720 --> 15:44.790
Take that!

15:45.320 --> 15:48.900
Yakuzen Kusuri. Winding up is inefficient.

15:48.900 --> 15:52.550
Well, Nano too efficient!
Pitching machine!

15:52.850 --> 15:53.950
Got it!

15:56.930 --> 15:58.930
What're you even catching it with?

16:00.040 --> 16:03.190
H-Here it comes, Kurumi-san!

16:04.390 --> 16:05.690
Sorry!

16:10.650 --> 16:12.700
This reminds me...

16:12.990 --> 16:15.870
of all those chocolates
with baseball wrappings I used to eat.

16:15.870 --> 16:19.200
They were so satisfying because
they were full spheres, not half.

16:19.830 --> 16:22.830
(nom)

16:20.740 --> 16:22.830
What are you even catching it with?

16:23.140 --> 16:26.330
Now, Shizuka-sama, allow me...

16:26.330 --> 16:31.340
(tremble)
(badump badump)

16:27.530 --> 16:29.640
"Feel free to come by."

16:29.640 --> 16:31.340
She is mighty terrified!

16:31.780 --> 16:33.120
Here I go.

16:33.120 --> 16:36.710
Hey, who said you could
practice fielding grounders?

16:33.590 --> 16:36.930
(relief)

16:38.620 --> 16:41.300
Next up is another
fundamental: practice swings.

16:41.300 --> 16:44.480
Let's get you all accustomed
to holding a bat first.

16:44.480 --> 16:45.230
Also...

16:45.520 --> 16:48.160
Kusuri-senpai, one bat is enough.

16:48.160 --> 16:49.610
But this cool.

16:50.020 --> 16:51.940
Karane, that's not a weapon.

16:50.950 --> 16:52.610
Oni... Giri!

16:52.610 --> 16:55.360
(krrrrrr)

16:53.560 --> 16:55.360
It's not a bat-zel either.

16:56.140 --> 16:59.870
Ta... lly... ho!

16:59.870 --> 17:01.950
(spin spin)

17:00.230 --> 17:02.040
She flew into a spin!

17:02.040 --> 17:04.079
She's so cute, it's a sin!

17:03.770 --> 17:06.329
(spin spin)

17:04.079 --> 17:06.329
You flew into a spin!

17:15.829 --> 17:17.530
Thirty-five!

17:17.530 --> 17:19.240
Thirty-six!

17:19.240 --> 17:21.030
Thirty-seven!

17:23.530 --> 17:26.849
"Grah! They took me arms!"

17:26.849 --> 17:31.450
1,528! 1,529! Good work!

17:27.770 --> 17:30.710
Let's call it a day. Good work, everyone.

17:31.450 --> 17:34.580
1,531! 1,532!

17:31.860 --> 17:33.920
Aren't you going home, Iku?

17:34.580 --> 17:37.500
I'll practice some more before I go.

17:37.500 --> 17:38.870
I'll stay behind too, then.

17:39.130 --> 17:43.140
Nah, you see them home.

17:43.140 --> 17:45.760
I always stay late practicing, anyway.

17:45.760 --> 17:48.330
I can't believe she's still going.

17:48.330 --> 17:50.380
That's a student athlete for you.

17:50.380 --> 17:53.480
See ya 'morrow, Iku!

17:53.480 --> 17:55.200
"Fare thee well."

17:55.200 --> 17:57.130
Thanks! You guys too!

17:57.470 --> 18:00.800
1,546! 1,547!

18:00.890 --> 18:03.640
(The Next Day)

18:02.360 --> 18:03.640
Owwie!

18:03.640 --> 18:05.390
My muscles are all sore!

18:05.390 --> 18:06.890
Come on, buck up!

18:07.150 --> 18:10.060
Are we seriously gonna
practice again today?

18:11.900 --> 18:15.740
101,128! 101,129! 101,130!

18:15.740 --> 18:18.150
- Stop the count!
101,128! 101,129! 101,130!

18:18.680 --> 18:20.200
Hey, Iku?

18:20.200 --> 18:24.890
Oh, good evening, guys.
Why are you here so late?

18:24.890 --> 18:26.540
She's still in late-night mode!

18:26.830 --> 18:30.960
Iku stuck living in the past?!

18:30.960 --> 18:33.170
I don't know if you're
being literal or figurative.

18:33.170 --> 18:35.380
H-Huh?

18:35.380 --> 18:38.780
That's weird. The world is spinning.

18:38.780 --> 18:41.330
And I'm seeing eight
of Rentaro's girlfriend.

18:41.330 --> 18:43.090
That part's accurate, actually.

18:43.090 --> 18:44.210
Ooh, the pain.

18:44.210 --> 18:45.210
- Iku-chan!
Ooh, the pain.

18:46.680 --> 18:48.180
(Nurse's Office)

18:48.180 --> 18:51.060
Who practices all night? Is she stupid?

18:51.780 --> 18:54.000
Of course she'd collapse from exhaustion.

18:54.000 --> 18:54.940
Iku...

18:54.940 --> 18:57.860
Didn't know Iku such an extreme masochist.

18:57.860 --> 18:58.700
No.

18:58.700 --> 19:01.160
I don't think this is normal.

19:01.160 --> 19:03.200
Why would she be so reckless?

19:03.760 --> 19:06.080
It's not like she was under orders.

19:06.080 --> 19:10.330
That wouldn't make it okay.
Please realize this.

19:11.540 --> 19:14.110
Homeroom's about to start.

19:14.110 --> 19:15.900
You should go to class.

19:37.560 --> 19:39.790
I have to practice.

19:43.450 --> 19:45.650
Iku? Where do you think you're going?

19:45.650 --> 19:47.470
You need to stay in bed!

19:47.470 --> 19:49.120
But I need to practice.

19:49.610 --> 19:52.710
Thanks to you and the girls,
we can actually play the upcoming game.

19:53.130 --> 19:56.210
That means I have to make sure that I win!

19:57.620 --> 20:03.540
If I shut them out while pitching
and hit a homer, we can win!

20:03.540 --> 20:06.970
- So I need more practice!
- Iku, I get where you're coming from, but...

20:06.970 --> 20:09.720
Sorry, Rentaro! Don't try to stop me!

20:10.280 --> 20:12.730
We've got class right now.

20:13.790 --> 20:15.530
Welp, you got me there.

20:16.460 --> 20:19.860
Wait, how are you here, then?

20:20.170 --> 20:24.260
I was so worried, I've been taking
bathroom breaks every five minutes

20:20.680 --> 20:23.710
Sensei! May I go to the bathroom, please?

20:24.260 --> 20:26.030
and coming to check on you.

20:26.360 --> 20:30.290
And I drank two liters of water
each break to recharge my bladder.

20:30.290 --> 20:31.120
Hngh!

20:30.370 --> 20:31.120
(hngh!!!)

20:31.120 --> 20:33.740
Th-Thanks, Rentaro.

20:33.740 --> 20:38.340
Iku, if you won't stop going overboard,
I'm left with no choice.

20:40.130 --> 20:44.560
Operation Ice-Bucket-Challenge-in-Loincloth-
to-Develop-a-Fever-and-Collapse-Before-Iku

20:44.560 --> 20:48.170
So-She-Doesn't-Go-Overboard is a go.

20:51.720 --> 20:54.080
Okay, that's it for today.

20:54.080 --> 20:56.270
Great work, everybody.

20:56.270 --> 20:57.400
You should call it too...

20:57.730 --> 21:00.000
Nah, I'm good.

21:00.000 --> 21:01.900
I want to practice more.

21:03.890 --> 21:06.910
Sorry, everyone.
You can go ahead and leave again.

21:07.800 --> 21:09.660
Iku, if you're practicing,

21:10.270 --> 21:12.160
we're staying behind too!

21:13.060 --> 21:13.830
Huh?

21:14.340 --> 21:15.080
Huh?

21:15.550 --> 21:19.570
Hanazono Hahari told us
why you're doing this.

21:19.570 --> 21:26.080
Sorry, I heard everything when I hid under
your bed to sneak photos of you sleeping.

21:26.080 --> 21:30.210
Such love for your students...
How admirable, how emphatic!

21:30.210 --> 21:31.470
More like lunatic.

21:31.770 --> 21:36.190
"You seek victory to reward us
for our cooperation?"

21:36.190 --> 21:40.500
Quit being conceited.
There is no "I" in "team."

21:40.500 --> 21:45.760
But we're total newbies.
How can she trust us?

21:45.760 --> 21:50.120
Yeah, but we'll practice and get better,

21:50.120 --> 21:53.510
so count on us
so we can win as a team, aye!

21:54.370 --> 21:55.320
You guys...

21:55.320 --> 21:57.120
What's with the loincloth?!

21:57.570 --> 22:00.640
Don't sweat the minor details!

22:00.640 --> 22:03.300
You call this insanity a minor detail?

22:04.380 --> 22:06.200
Once more, together.

22:08.190 --> 22:09.750
Rentaro Family...

22:11.260 --> 22:13.290
Let's win this for sure!

22:13.290 --> 22:16.020
Yeah!
